1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,480
Reporting to Grand Elder

25
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:54,040
Elders Pu Lin, Gu Cheng and Kun Sang

26
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,960
have requested reinforcements.

27
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:01,760
Qian Kun\NFighting Evil Sect Grand Elder\NMiddle stage Core Formation

28
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,450
Grand Elder,

29
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:10,120
should we go ?

30
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,720
Our Fighting Evil Sect's territory

31
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:28,440
is not to be messed with.

32
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,840
Pu Lin !

33
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:55,520
This isn't a regular Foundation Establishment cultivator.

34
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,280
This guy is about to

35
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:59,040
enter the Core Formation stage !

36
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:02,600
After one day and one night,

37
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,880
my flying sword's attacks are no longer as effective.

38
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:07,400
My Ji Realm is only able to injure them

39
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,440
but not kill them.

40
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:12,160
It seems I only have a single card left.

41
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:30,520
Even if the Underworld Ice Flame is strong,

42
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,000
it's like a tree without roots.

43
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,560
Using it like this will consume the flame

44
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,120
at a very fast pace.

45
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:38,600
I have no choice but to risk it...

46
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:46,280
Grand Elder !

47
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:49,400
Three more Core Formations have arrived...

48
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:51,440
The leader is at Middle stage Core Formation.

49
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,560
Now that reinforcements have arrived

50
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:58,480
I can't risk shattering my Core embryo

51
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,040
to kill them anymore.

52
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,880
Little brat,

53
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,840
you killed an Elder of our Fighting Evil Sect.

54
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:07,720
No matter how far you flee,

55
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:10,040
we will still kill you !

56
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:15,320
I have one last idea.

57
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,510
Although it will be dangerous,

58
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:19,240
it will all be over

59
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,960
if I succeed.

60
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,640
Faster, I must go faster !

61
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,400
It's been 3 years

62
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:42,240
and I still haven't heard from him...

63
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,920
Back then, he saved my life.

64
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,160
And then he promised

65
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:50,680
to send me back to the Burning Fire Alliance.

66
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:56,320
I wonder if he will ever come back...

67
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,360
Senior !

68
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:17,240
Senior...

69
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:19,080
What's wrong ?

70
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:20,200
What happened ?

71
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,040
Little brat,

72
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:28,880
why did you stop running ?

73
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:28,880
Wu Liu\NFighting Evil Sect Elder\NEarly stage Core Formation

74
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:46,040
Da Tou (Big Head)\NFighting Evil Sect Elder\NEarly stage Core Formation

75
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:44,640
That young woman we just saw

76
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,160
belongs to me !

77
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:49,360
It just happened that I needed a cultivation furnace !

78
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:55,840
When did such a formation appear here ?

79
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:58,240
Since this formation can summon a dragon,

80
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,800
it can't be ordinary...

81
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,240
Kun Sang,

82
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,040
try using your Thousand Peaks Seal Stamp.

83
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:41,320
This really is a good formation...

84
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,040
Fellow Elders,

85
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:45,640
let's attack this formation together !

86
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:56,240
This is the Great Annihilation Talisman ?

87
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,600
If not for your Flood Dragon armor,

88
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,240
I would've died by now.

89
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:08,880
His talisman is very powerful

90
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:11,960
with his Middle stage Core Formation cultivation.

91
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:23,120
This is a grade 5 pill furnace.

92
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:26,840
Refine the Heaven Separating Pill as fast as you can.

93
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,480
This...

94
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,240
Are they chasing you

95
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:35,080
because of this furnace !?

96
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:36,240
No.

97
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,480
We only have one way out now.

98
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,400
You must refine the pill

99
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:41,880
so I can reach Core Formation.

100
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:44,360
We won't walk out of this cave alive

101
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,960
if I'm not Core Formation.

102
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,680
I must succeed...

103
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,200
I must succeed...

104
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,240
If the formation breaks,

105
00:08:17,280 --> 00:08:18,680
it will all be over !

106
00:08:49,640 --> 00:08:50,240
Break !

107
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,240
I failed...

108
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:11,800
I can't just give up like this !

109
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:13,560
I still have the Demon Blood Vine.

110
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,320
We still have time...

111
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:40,920
Senior !

112
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:42,960
Senior...

113
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:46,320
This is a Heaven Separating Pill made from Demon Blood Vine.

114
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:48,720
Its effect isn't... as good.

115
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:49,200
But !

116
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:04,120
How much longer

117
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,360
can the formation hold ?

118
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:08,680
If 5 Core Formations keep attacking it like that,

119
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:09,960
no more than 4 days.

120
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,560
I will reach Core Formation as soon as possible.

121
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:29,560
3 days later

122
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:50,040
This formation is no joke,

123
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:52,200
it didn't break after 3 days.

124
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:53,440
Da Tou,

125
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:57,640
if you want that woman, you need to deserve her.

126
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:46,440
Break !

127
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,800
The formation... is gone...

128
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:04,200
There's actually another formation !

129
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:06,760
Everyone, let me handle this !

130
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:19,560
At this distance,

131
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:21,800
I will be able to trap that brat

132
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:25,920
by using the Immortal Trapping Net the moment he walks out.

133
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:38,480
Is this what you want ?

134
00:12:41,640 --> 00:12:44,080
I didn't expect that little bastard would be able to buy

135
00:12:44,320 --> 00:12:48,120
that pill furnace for 100 000 high-quality spirit stones !

136
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:51,840
Give it to me, little girl.

137
00:12:58,480 --> 00:13:00,720
Grand Elder, this pill furnace belongs to me now !

138
00:13:00,760 --> 00:13:03,600
I will definitely repay you later, what do you think ?

139
00:13:03,920 --> 00:13:05,120
You wish !

140
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:13,120
Explode !

141
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:24,960
How dare you destroy that pill furnace !?

142
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:57,840
Since you're looking for death,

143
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,680
I shall grant your wish !

144
00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:15,240
He saved my life in the first place...

145
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:19,440
I am just repaying him...

146
00:15:24,560 --> 00:15:25,480
Step back !

147
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:38,640
He killed a Core Formation cultivator in an instant !?

148
00:15:39,640 --> 00:15:41,520
What kind of monster is he !?

149
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:01,200
Wait for me.

150
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:06,960
From now on,

151
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,680
I'm the strongest person below Nascent Soul.

152
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:13,720
Wang Lin\NEarly stage Core Formation

153
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:14,160
If none of you are hiding your cultivation

154
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:16,960
then you can all

155
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:20,960
die.

156
00:16:51,760 --> 00:16:52,560
Run !

157
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:55,880
I have never been afraid

158
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:57,240
within South Dipper City.

159
00:16:58,040 --> 00:16:59,160
This is the first

160
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:01,520
and only time in my life

161
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:02,880
that I've been afraid.

162
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:08,000
Let's go.

163
00:17:10,120 --> 00:17:10,920
Where ?

164
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:14,320
We have some people to kill.

165
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:42,140
I've been walking this path for endless years

166
00:17:38,800 --> 00:17:42,140
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

167
00:17:42,780 --> 00:17:47,740
Is it the compass of fate

168
00:17:44,620 --> 00:17:47,740
that wrote this outcome for us ?

169
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:53,660
The heavens want to erase your existence,

170
00:17:53,780 --> 00:17:59,380
that's the obsession guiding me.

171
00:17:59,660 --> 00:18:04,980
Is this the path to uncover

172
00:18:01,540 --> 00:18:04,980
truths from falsehoods ?

173
00:18:05,260 --> 00:18:10,580
In a world of murk and shadow,

174
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:10,580
only the flame of truth can light the way.

175
00:18:10,620 --> 00:18:16,300
Look at them all,

176
00:18:13,500 --> 00:18:16,300
being carried by the waves.

177
00:18:16,740 --> 00:18:20,940
Look at them all,

178
00:18:18,900 --> 00:18:20,940
being drowned.

179
00:18:21,020 --> 00:18:24,260
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

180
00:18:24,300 --> 00:18:27,340
I will let the world refine my soul.

181
00:18:27,470 --> 00:18:32,900
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

182
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:32,900
I will fight.

183
00:18:32,900 --> 00:18:36,020
I'll break through the abyss of despair

184
00:18:36,020 --> 00:18:39,060
to finally learn who I really am.

185
00:18:39,060 --> 00:18:44,420
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

186
00:18:40,940 --> 00:18:44,420
I embrace this obsession.

187
00:18:44,420 --> 00:18:47,380
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

188
00:18:47,380 --> 00:18:50,180
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

189
00:18:50,180 --> 00:18:55,660
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

190
00:18:52,220 --> 00:18:55,660
I'll still fight.

191
00:18:55,860 --> 00:18:59,020
It's hard to avoid loneliness

192
00:18:59,020 --> 00:19:02,060
when you are above everyone else.

193
00:19:02,060 --> 00:19:07,740
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

194
00:19:04,380 --> 00:19:07,740
be afraid of a firefly ?
